# A real trackpad pinch is many tiny deltas: a new font size every frame.
# Each size used to stay in afterhours' fixed font atlas until it filled, and
# from then on every new glyph was dropped from drawing and measurement, so
# the whole UI lost letters until restart. 1.005^220 ~= 3.0, then back down.
# The open diff brings the code font, enough glyphs to fill the atlas.
make_test_repo
resize 1280 720
wait_for_refresh
wait_frames 5
click_text "README.md"
wait_frames 5
pinch 0.005
wait_frames 1
